OL,3,GNEWSALook North sofa push passes
OL,4,Athrough West Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC Look North's Push for Pudsey
OL,7,Fteam will be taking the programme's red
OL,8,Fsofa through West Yorkshire on the
OL,9,Fpenultimate day of their Children in
OL,10,FNeed fundraising challenge.
OL,12,FStarting in Meltham at 09:00 GMT,
OL,13,Fpresenter Amy Garcia and fundraiser
OL,14,FLindsey Burrow will push and pull the
OL,15,Fsoft furnishing through Netherthong,
OL,16,FBrockholes and Holmfirth, before they
OL,17,Ffinish at the Holme Moss summit at
OL,18,F16:00.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
