OL,3,GNEWSALook North sofa push passes
OL,4,Athrough West Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crowd gathered Morrisons in Meltham
OL,7,Fto wave them off on day four, before
OL,8,Fthey began a steep climb through Honley
OL,9,FWoods.
OL,11,FAmy and Lindsey hope to complete their
OL,12,F80-mile (129km) trek through the region
OL,13,Fon Friday, when Look North will be
OL,14,Fbroadcast live from Wakefield Trinity's
OL,15,FDIY Kitchens Stadium.
